---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/base-layout.astro";
---

<BaseLayout title="About | PixelBrewer">
  <article>
    <header>
      <h1>About</h1>
    </header>

    <p>
      I'm Alex Blair, a software developer who enjoys building things,
      learning how systems work, and following curiosity into projects that
      are probably more complicated than they need to be.
    </p>

    <p>
      I spend a lot of my time exploring C++, game development, graphics,
      backend systems, developer tooling, and Linux. I especially like
      projects that give me an excuse to understand what is happening under
      the hood rather than treating technology as a black box.
    </p>

    <p>
      Outside of programming, I'm usually drinking coffee, playing strategy
      games, practicing kendo, skiing, or spending time with my cats.
    </p>

    <p>
      PixelBrewer is where I write about what I'm learning, document projects
      I'm working on, and share the things I find interesting along the way.
    </p>

    <p>
      You can find more of my work on
      <a href="https://github.com/PixelBrewer">GitHub</a>.
    </p>
  </article>
</BaseLayout>
